# The start of the video options' check as a script (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC3; video.kps's first steps):
# zerg01's first view settled, its video options logged and kept by a mark, F10, O and V open the video dialog by their
# keys, its tree written to video.ui (the choices' places for a script), then Escape until no dialog is open and the
# options are as they were. tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission zerg/zerg01
options originals
clock real

wait game
wait frames 90
mark start
log start video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting video.serial video.commits gamma portraits
log art art.scale art.lit art.fx hd.ui text.vector
state start
shot start
key F10
wait dialog gamemenu
key O
wait dialog options
key V
wait dialog video
ui video
shot video
until nodialog key Escape
expect video.commits == @start.video.commits and gamma == @start.gamma and video.graphics == @start.video.graphics
log end video.graphics video.commits gamma
